# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SECRETS
#
# This repo is PUBLIC. Everything below is a credential that would compromise
# either the game server or the AWS account, and none of it belongs in git under
# any circumstances. A secret-scanning gate backs this up on every commit --
# .gitignore is the first line, not the only one.
#
# Where these actually live:
#   AWS            -> the EC2 instance IAM role. There is no key file.
#   Discord OAuth  -> environment, on the Ringmaster host
#   session secret -> environment, on the Ringmaster host
#   ingest secret  -> environment on both hosts
#   SSH key        -> the Ringmaster host only, never checked in
#
# There is deliberately no RCON password in that list. `rcon_password` stays
# unset on the game host, which is FXServer's own default. See the README.
#
# (The backticks above are load-bearing: check-secrets.mjs flags that token
# followed by whitespace, and prose about it trips the rule. Quoting the token
# is the right fix; loosening the rule is not.)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
credentials
.aws/

# Working memory, not documentation. Session handoff notes -- the README is the
# documentation, and PLAN.md is deliberately allowed to be messy and current.
# Same convention as the gamemode repo.
PLAN.md

# Local overrides
*.local
config.local.*

# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# Editors / OS
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
